  "notes": "19:6-13 not glossed (the tafsirs differ on what «وإن تنتهوا» refers to; As-Sa'di's «حزب الله» is avoided as a modern political term). Geometric for «وأن الله موهن كيد الكافرين», light for «وأن الله مع المؤمنين». STAGING v4: Kept ambient (owner rule, Staging v4): Badr and the challenge to the disbelievers. c1 (18) moves from dawn to the geometric mood: no dawn over the outcome of Badr and the threat to the disbelievers (review M7). c2: the plate for Allah being with the believers (19:21) is now geometric instead of light, because a light plate drawing on one word before the Name reads as Him appearing as light."
